# Single source of truth for the data-index Release.
#
# data-index.tar.gz (rfam / mature / PmiREN blast indices) evolves on its own
# schedule, independently of the software version, so the Release that hosts it is
# deliberately NOT derived from the version of the code.  Both GitHub workflows and
# test.sh read the tag from this file; the README and CONTRIBUTING.md quote the same
# tag in their download commands.
#
# To publish a new index:
#   1. create a Release (a `data-v*` tag is a good choice) and upload data-index.tar.gz;
#   2. change the single line below;
#   3. update the two wget commands in README.md / CONTRIBUTING.md;
#   4. re-run CI (test.sh picks the new index up automatically).
DATA_INDEX_RELEASE=mirdeep-p3-v3.1.4c-full
